# Baseline config for CBMC scan.
#
# Turns on the minimum set of kernel features that any scan harness
# assumes: 64-bit x86_64, multi-user, and just enough plumbing for
# most subsystems to be switchable on top.  Deliberately modest.
#
# Combine with a per-scan-target fragment (e.g. crypto-aead.config)
# via scan/configure.sh.
CONFIG_64BIT=y
CONFIG_X86_64=y
CONFIG_MULTIUSER=y
CONFIG_HIGH_RES_TIMERS=y
